Z||000012||Loki||07-10-2001||04:38 PM||||How did you do the chin spoiler?  I wanna do something similar....Info? Specs? Dimensions?<BR><P>------------------<BR>Loki<BR>ICQ# 16477998||||reg||1
Z||000013||skitime||07-10-2001||04:52 PM||||Loki - What I did was cut the bottom off an old GT nose and turn it upside down. I cut the rear reflector pockets off a rear facia and molded it into the spoiler for the driving lights.  Time consuming but not really hard.  The coolest thing is it made of the same material of the nose so it will not break like the fiberglass ones. Anyone that has had a chin spoiler knows sooner or later you will bump it. Also the spoiler is of course and exact match of the nose.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000014||Loki||07-10-2001||05:13 PM||||Sweet...Now then to locate some messed up front and rear facias...eheh Thanx<BR><P>------------------<BR>Loki<BR>ICQ# 16477998||||reg||1
